-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted">I'm currently focused on defining the initial scope for a mobile application tailored for Chandra Printers in Kanpur. It's crucial to map the printing business's needs into a functional product. Details on brand identity, including their location and proprietor, are being incorporated.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></ms-cmark-node></p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" _nghost-ng-c2452056902=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" _nghost-ng-c2452056902=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted">Refining Technical Specifications</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></ms-cmark-node></strong><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></ms-cmark-node></p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" _nghost-ng-c2452056902=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted">I'm now diving into the technical specifics. Considering the color scheme (dark with gold and crimson), I'm incorporating the provided hex codes. The application's core features are taking shape, encompassing a customer app with categories, smart ordering, and payment options (COD, UPI, and readying for Razorpay). I'm also planning the customer account, admin dashboard, and file uploads. Furthermore, I'll integrate notifications and contact via WhatsApp and direct call. Finally, I'm focusing on providing the complete codebase for APK building.</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></ms-cmark-node></p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" _nghost-ng-c2452056902=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" _nghost-ng-c2452056902=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted">Specifying Mobile Architecture</span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></ms-cmark-node></strong><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></ms-cmark-node></p><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2452056902="" _nghost-ng-c2452056902=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent